ience and a willingness to be flexible in class scheduling is preferred. Years of Experience Full Time/Part Time Part-Time Annual Schedule N/A Rank Part Time/Adjunct Faculty Tenure Non-Tenure Track Is this posting collecting references? No- Do not provide references at this time. Posting Details Posting Details Posting Number F00616P Open Date 08/07/2026 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Complete applications are to include a cover letter and CV. This is a pooled position from which Adjunct/Affiliates will be hired as needed. As openings occur, we will draw candidates from this pool until May 2027 or until positions are filled for the current academic year. Applicants not chosen are invited to re-apply for consideration on or after June 1, 2027. Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Cover Letter Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Reference Contact Information \u00a9 2013 The University of Scranton Scranton, Pennsylvania 18510 (570) 941-7400 Office of Human Resources | St. Thomas Hall, Suite 100 | The University of Scranton | Scranton, PA 18510-4633 | Phone: 570-941-7767 | Fax: 570-941-4636 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."}, "https://universityofscrantonjobs.com/postings/8909": {"title": "Adjunct Faculty - Spanish Language Instructor", "description": "The University of Scranton Applicant Portal | Adjunct Faculty - Spanish Language Instructor Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help HR Homepage Adjunct Faculty - Spanish Language Instructor Bookmark this Requisition Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Complete applications are to include a cover letter and CV. This is a pooled position from which Adjunct/Affiliates will be hired as nee