rapy or related major. Preferred Education ABD or doctorate in Occupational Therapy or related major Minimum Job Experience Requirements Preferred Qualifications Current clinical practice experience and previous teaching experience. Years of Experience Full Time/Part Time Part-Time Annual Schedule N/A Rank Part Time/Adjunct Faculty Tenure Non-Tenure Track Is this posting collecting references? No- Do not provide references at this time. Posting Details Posting Details Posting Number F00600P Open Date 05/22/2026 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Complete applications are to include a cover letter and CV. This is a pooled position from which Adjunct/Affiliates will be hired as needed. As openings occur, we will draw candidates from this pool until May 2027 or until positions are filled for the current academic year. Applicants not chosen are invited to re-apply for consideration on or after June 1, 2027. Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Cover Letter Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Reference Contact Information \u00a9 2013 The University of Scranton Scranton, Pennsylvania 18510 (570) 941-7400 Office of Human Resources | St. Thomas Hall, Suite 100 | The University of Scranton | Scranton, PA 18510-4633 | Phone: 570-941-7767 | Fax: 570-941-4636 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."}, "https://universityofscrantonjobs.com/postings/8786": {"title": "Adjunct Faculty - Economics", "description": "The University of Scranton Applicant Portal | Adjunct Faculty - Economics Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help HR Homepage Adjunct Faculty - Economics Bookmark this Requisition Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Complete applications are to i